; AurumFunded v1.15 - FTMO funded-style run (no profit target, so the run does not stop at +10%) with the variance-premium leg
; (research/vrp_gap_equity_indices.py). The preset is the OFF run (InpVrpMult=0); the on run adds InpVrpMult=0.5 (queue compare_set).
; Tester only until the judge has passed it. VIX source: the broker symbol InpVrpVix if it exists (FTMO has none), else the file
; vixcls.csv in the common Files folder (python research/vrp_vix_file.py writes it, days before 2025-10-13 only).
InpPropTargetPct=0.0
InpPropRound=3
InpPropMinDays=4
InpPropDayStopPct=3.0
InpPropMaxStopPct=8.5
InpPropTrailing=false
InpPropRoomPct=8.5
InpPropCap=1.4
InpPropResetHHMM=100
InpEuClock=true
InpSizeMult=0.5
InpGridRiskPct=0.0
InpHoldVolPct=0.0
InpPropFast=false
InpBreakRiskPct=0.125
InpNoiseMult=0.275
InpVrpMult=0.0
InpVrpVix=VIX.cash
InpVrpVixFile=vixcls.csv
InpVrpHHMM=2230
InpVrpEntrySec=600
InpVrpMaxSpreadBp=3.0
InpVrpStopEqPct=5.0
